{"id": "34506", "title": "娶了你啰！", "author": "陈毓华", "category": "文学名著", "count": 44, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/34/34506.htm", "intro": "他真的真的抱歉！曾经为了征服男人的世界,放任她在寂寞的婚姻里寂寞,所以,带着满满的悔和Love,找小鬼的妈咪兼他的亲亲老婆来了,只是……她有必要忘他忘得那幺彻底,连两人爱的结晶都没丁点记忆？伤心的人更该发奋图强,爱人爱溜冰他奉陪到底,就算对冰这玩意儿他小生怕怕,就算被儿子取笑他冰上功夫是「小妞妞」,他也不在乎,可她溜冰溜到被雪埋、脚受伤,怎会叫他送她到兽医院或庙里……", "base": "files/article/html/34/34506", "chapters": [{"title": "序言", "file": "2189116.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第1页", "file": "2189117.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第2页", "file": "2189118.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第3页", "file": "2189119.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第4页", "file": "2189120.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第5页", "file": "2189121.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第6页", "file": "2189122.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第7页", "file": "2189123.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第8页", "file": "2189124.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第9页", "file": "2189125.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第10页", "file": "2189126.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第11页", "file": "2189127.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第12页", "file": "2189128.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第13页", "file": "2189129.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第14页", "file": "2189130.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第15页", "file": "2189131.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第16页", "file": "2189132.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第17页", "file": "2189133.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第18页", "file": "2189134.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第19页", "file": "2189135.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第20页", "file": "2189136.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第21页", "file": "2189137.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第22页", "file": "2189138.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第23页", "file": "2189139.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第24页", "file": "2189140.html", "available": false}, {"title": "